{
  "about": "Places quality gate: 20 real asks, run through Composer's search_places tool without the AI (php artisan places:check-matrix). 'input' is the tool call the AI should make for the ask; the AI session's own eval checks that mapping. Times are Europe/Berlin; the person is at the Dom unless 'from' says otherwise.",
